07", "version": "1.0.4", "version_code": 47, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1640546138071320"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed an issue where desyncs and subsequent crashes could occur when clients with different minor versions match together.", "created_date": 1782280079, "id": "1638924201566847", "version": "1.0.3", "version_code": 46, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1640546138071320"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "Disabled microphone input.\nFixed an issue where players could fall through the floor.\nAdded player mute/unmute functionality.\nAdded Snap Turn locomotion option.\nPlayers now spawn at the main starting area instead of the Broadcast Zone.\nReplaced AI-generated images with updated artwork.\nBlade now appears on the player's back when not equipped.\nFixed an issue in Team Mode where players could enter the opposing team's side.\nIncreased initial ball speed to improve early match pacing.\nPlayers can now return to the 